{"id":"vol8-08","section":1,"path":"bank/listening/vol8-08/audio-1.m4a","model":"small","duration":443.52,"segments":[{"start":0.05,"end":2.29,"text":"version 56120.","words":[["version",0.05,0.65],["56120.",0.65,2.29]]},{"start":4.67,"end":9.93,"text":"You will hear a number of different recordings, and you will have to answer questions on what","words":[["You",4.67,4.97],["will",4.97,5.17],["hear",5.17,5.39],["a",5.39,5.57],["number",5.57,5.89],["of",5.89,6.13],["different",6.13,6.43],["recordings,",6.43,7.01],["and",7.69,7.87],["you",7.87,8.05],["will",8.05,8.15],["have",8.15,8.33],["to",8.33,8.47],["answer",8.47,8.79],["questions",8.79,9.33],["on",9.33,9.75],["what",9.75,9.93]]},{"start":9.93,"end":10.51,"text":"you hear.","words":[["you",9.93,10.13],["hear.",10.13,10.51]]},{"start":11.33,"end":16.35,"text":"There will be time for you to read the instructions and questions, and you will have a chance","words":[["There",11.33,11.73],["will",11.73,11.87],["be",11.87,12.03],["time",12.03,12.37],["for",12.37,12.65],["you",12.65,12.75],["to",12.75,12.85],["read",12.85,13.15],["the",13.15,13.39],["instructions",13.39,13.93],["and",13.93,14.23],["questions,",14.23,14.59],["and",15.25,15.53],["you",15.53,15.69],["will",15.69,15.81],["have",15.81,15.95],["a",15.95,16.09],["chance",16.09,16.35]]},{"start":16.35,"end":17.51,"text":"to check your work.","words":[["to",16.35,16.59],["check",16.59,16.89],["your",16.89,17.11],["work.",17.11,17.51]]},{"start":18.67,"end":21.83,"text":"All the recordings will be played once only.","words":[["All",18.67,18.87],["the",18.87,18.99],["recordings",18.99,19.43],["will",19.43,20.03],["be",20.03,20.17],["played",20.17,20.59],["once",20.59,21.17],["only.",21.17,21.83]]},{"start":23.01,"end":25.59,"text":"The test is in four parts.","words":[["The",23.01,23.37],["test",23.37,23.79],["is",23.79,24.49],["in",24.49,24.63],["four",24.63,24.99],["parts.",24.99,25.59]]},{"start":25.59,"end":29.63,"text":"Write all your answers in the listening question booklet.","words":[["Write",25.59,26.59],["all",26.59,26.93],["your",26.93,27.11],["answers",27.11,27.53],["in",27.53,28.21],["the",28.21,28.35],["listening",28.35,28.69],["question",28.69,29.15],["booklet.",29.15,29.63]]},{"start":30.31,"end":36.61,"text":"At the end of the test, you will be given 10 minutes to transfer your answers to an answer sheet.","words":[["At",30.31,30.95],["the",30.95,31.07],["end",31.07,31.29],["of",31.29,31.41],["the",31.41,31.51],["test,",31.51,31.87],["you",32.25,32.51],["will",32.51,32.65],["be",32.65,32.81],["given",32.81,33.09],["10",33.09,33.51],["minutes",33.51,33.89],["to",33.89,34.23],["transfer",34.23,34.83],["your",34.83,35.05],["answers",35.05,35.47],["to",35.47,35.77],["an",35.77,35.95],["answer",35.95,36.25],["sheet.",36.25,36.61]]},{"start":38.65,"end":42.91,"text":"Now turn to Part 1 on page 2 of your question booklet.","words":[["Now",38.65,39.03],["turn",39.03,39.27],["to",39.27,39.51],["Part",39.51,39.75],["1",39.75,40.09],["on",40.09,40.95],["page",40.95,41.33],["2",41.33,41.81],["of",41.81,42.01],["your",42.01,42.11],["question",42.11,42.45],["booklet.",42.45,42.91]]},{"start":47.97,"end":55.21,"text":"Part 1. You will hear a woman talking to an agent who is responsible for flat rentals.","words":[["Part",47.97,48.33],["1.",48.33,48.89],["You",49.63,50.31],["will",50.31,50.53],["hear",50.53,50.73],["a",50.73,50.89],["woman",50.89,51.11],["talking",51.11,51.57],["to",51.57,51.89],["an",51.89,52.03],["agent",52.03,52.31],["who",52.31,52.91],["is",52.91,53.05],["responsible",53.05,53.63],["for",53.63,54.09],["flat",54.09,54.43],["rentals.",54.43,55.21]]},{"start":56.15,"end":60.27,"text":"First, you have some time to look at questions 1 to 6.","words":[["First,",56.15,56.51],["you",56.95,57.15],["have",57.15,57.29],["some",57.29,57.49],["time",57.49,57.83],["to",57.83,58.03],["look",58.03,58.13],["at",58.13,58.29],["questions",58.29,58.67],["1",58.67,59.43],["to",59.43,59.91],["6.",59.91,60.27]]},{"start":60.27,"end":94.68,"text":"Now listen carefully and answer questions one to six.","words":[["Now",60.27,61.29],["listen",91.08,91.42],["carefully",91.42,91.88],["and",91.88,92.42],["answer",92.42,92.72],["questions",92.72,93.22],["one",93.22,93.84],["to",93.84,94.3],["six.",94.3,94.68]]},{"start":98.08,"end":103.0,"text":"Hello, I've come in because I've got some problems in the flat I'm renting.","words":[["Hello,",98.08,98.62],["I've",99.08,99.68],["come",99.68,99.92],["in",99.92,100.14],["because",100.14,100.46],["I've",100.46,100.76],["got",100.76,100.88],["some",100.88,101.14],["problems",101.14,101.72],["in",101.72,102.04],["the",102.04,102.16],["flat",102.16,102.4],["I'm",102.4,102.68],["renting.",102.68,103.0]]},{"start":103.44,"end":105.02,"text":"Oh right, can I have your name?","words":[["Oh",103.44,103.66],["right,",103.66,103.92],["can",104.24,104.46],["I",104.46,104.58],["have",104.58,104.7],["your",104.7,104.8],["name?",104.8,105.02]]},{"start":105.64,"end":113.12,"text":"Yes, it's Eleanor Wozinski. I've been renting the flat at 13 Paulworth Road for three months now.","words":[["Yes,",105.64,105.96],["it's",106.26,106.72],["Eleanor",106.72,107.36],["Wozinski.",107.36,108.1],["I've",108.98,109.3],["been",109.3,109.44],["renting",109.44,109.7],["the",109.7,109.94],["flat",109.94,110.18],["at",110.18,110.34],["13",110.34,110.84],["Paulworth",110.84,111.54],["Road",111.54,111.88],["for",111.88,112.18],["three",112.18,112.46],["months",112.46,112.76],["now.",112.76,113.12]]},{"start":113.82,"end":116.42,"text":"Let me see, I'll just get the details.","words":[["Let",113.82,114.22],["me",114.22,114.38],["see,",114.38,114.84],["I'll",115.34,115.58],["just",115.58,115.72],["get",115.72,115.86],["the",115.86,115.98],["details.",115.98,116.42]]},{"start":117.5,"end":120.4,"text":"Oh yes, here we are. Are you alone in the flat?","words":[["Oh",117.5,117.96],["yes,",117.96,118.18],["here",118.32,118.42],["we",118.42,118.52],["are.",118.52,118.7],["Are",119.34,119.52],["you",119.52,119.62],["alone",119.62,119.9],["in",119.9,120.08],["the",120.08,120.18],["flat?",120.18,120.4]]},{"start":120.4,"end":127.1,"text":"no I originally rented it with a friend but now my cousin is there right so","words":[["no",120.4,121.1],["I",121.1,122.02],["originally",122.02,122.4],["rented",122.4,122.9],["it",122.9,123.1],["with",123.1,123.28],["a",123.28,123.44],["friend",123.44,123.8],["but",123.8,124.68],["now",124.68,124.96],["my",124.96,125.16],["cousin",125.16,125.48],["is",125.48,125.74],["there",125.74,125.96],["right",125.96,126.64],["so",126.64,127.1]]},{"start":127.1,"end":132.64,"text":"there's two of you and what's the problem loads of things have gone wrong or","words":[["there's",127.1,127.32],["two",127.32,127.62],["of",127.62,127.82],["you",127.82,128.04],["and",128.04,128.98],["what's",128.98,129.36],["the",129.36,129.44],["problem",129.44,129.8],["loads",129.8,130.68],["of",130.68,130.94],["things",130.94,131.14],["have",131.14,131.38],["gone",131.38,131.66],["wrong",131.66,132.1],["or",132.1,132.64]]},{"start":132.64,"end":138.74,"text":"are not working and my contract says the landlord is responsible for them yes","words":[["are",132.64,133.22],["not",133.22,133.38],["working",133.38,133.88],["and",133.88,134.84],["my",134.84,135.0],["contract",135.0,135.46],["says",135.46,135.92],["the",135.92,136.18],["landlord",136.18,136.52],["is",136.52,136.82],["responsible",136.82,137.38],["for",137.38,137.94],["them",137.94,138.12],["yes",138.12,138.74]]},{"start":138.74,"end":143.48,"text":"well that's right he will end up paying for the repairs but in the first","words":[["well",138.74,139.02],["that's",139.02,139.22],["right",139.22,139.44],["he",139.44,140.68],["will",140.68,140.86],["end",140.86,141.06],["up",141.06,141.18],["paying",141.18,141.46],["for",141.46,141.66],["the",141.66,141.76],["repairs",141.76,142.16],["but",142.16,142.74],["in",142.74,143.16],["the",143.16,143.3],["first",143.3,143.48]]},{"start":143.48,"end":147.86,"text":"instance you need to contact his service manager as he deals with the","words":[["instance",143.48,144.0],["you",144.0,144.46],["need",144.46,144.6],["to",144.6,144.74],["contact",144.74,145.1],["his",145.1,145.38],["service",145.38,145.8],["manager",145.8,146.16],["as",146.16,146.78],["he",146.78,147.04],["deals",147.04,147.34],["with",147.34,147.56],["the",147.56,147.86]]},{"start":147.86,"end":149.06,"text":"today running of the flats.","words":[["today",147.86,148.02],["running",148.02,148.3],["of",148.3,148.5],["the",148.5,148.6],["flats.",148.6,149.06]]},{"start":149.58,"end":150.56,"text":"Oh, OK.","words":[["Oh,",149.58,149.94],["OK.",150.2,150.56]]},{"start":151.36,"end":152.98,"text":"How do I get hold of him?","words":[["How",151.36,151.7],["do",151.7,151.8],["I",151.8,151.94],["get",151.94,152.16],["hold",152.16,152.56],["of",152.56,152.82],["him?",152.82,152.98]]},{"start":153.62,"end":155.38,"text":"I've got the contact details here.","words":[["I've",153.62,153.9],["got",153.9,154.04],["the",154.04,154.16],["contact",154.16,154.42],["details",154.42,154.82],["here.",154.82,155.38]]},{"start":155.72,"end":156.92,"text":"I'll write them down for you.","words":[["I'll",155.72,155.9],["write",155.9,156.06],["them",156.06,156.22],["down",156.22,156.4],["for",156.4,156.68],["you.",156.68,156.92]]},{"start":157.58,"end":159.14,"text":"But anyway, just for our records,","words":[["But",157.58,157.88],["anyway,",157.88,158.1],["just",158.24,158.3],["for",158.3,158.48],["our",158.48,158.62],["records,",158.62,159.14]]},{"start":159.5,"end":161.02,"text":"I should make a list of the problems.","words":[["I",159.5,159.64],["should",159.64,159.8],["make",159.8,159.98],["a",159.98,160.14],["list",160.14,160.34],["of",160.34,160.46],["the",160.46,160.58],["problems.",160.58,161.02]]},{"start":162.02,"end":164.86,"text":"Do you know how long they normally take to fix things?","words":[["Do",162.02,162.16],["you",162.16,162.3],["know",162.3,162.44],["how",162.44,162.64],["long",162.64,162.94],["they",162.94,163.16],["normally",163.16,163.48],["take",163.48,163.88],["to",163.88,164.06],["fix",164.06,164.34],["things?",164.34,164.86]]},{"start":165.5,"end":167.94,"text":"I'm afraid you'll have to wait till next week","words":[["I'm",165.5,165.76],["afraid",165.76,166.2],["you'll",166.2,166.56],["have",166.56,166.72],["to",166.72,166.88],["wait",166.88,167.06],["till",167.06,167.32],["next",167.32,167.56],["week",167.56,167.94]]},{"start":167.94,"end":169.18,"text":"before they can come over.","words":[["before",167.94,168.26],["they",168.26,168.46],["can",168.46,168.62],["come",168.62,168.82],["over.",168.82,169.18]]},{"start":169.76,"end":170.42,"text":"Oh, dear.","words":[["Oh,",169.76,170.02],["dear.",170.06,170.42]]},{"start":171.54,"end":174.14,"text":"Don't they do things more quickly if they're urgent?","words":[["Don't",171.54,171.92],["they",171.92,172.06],["do",172.06,172.24],["things",172.24,172.56],["more",172.56,172.78],["quickly",172.78,173.24],["if",173.24,173.48],["they're",173.48,173.68],["urgent?",173.68,174.14]]},{"start":174.62,"end":176.0,"text":"Not in my experience.","words":[["Not",174.62,175.08],["in",175.08,175.28],["my",175.28,175.4],["experience.",175.4,176.0]]},{"start":176.0,"end":182.28,"text":"Now, just looking through your contract here, it says you are expected to pay £50 towards","words":[["Now,",176.0,177.0],["just",177.16,177.38],["looking",177.38,177.68],["through",177.68,177.9],["your",177.9,178.06],["contract",178.06,178.5],["here,",178.5,178.92],["it",179.14,179.3],["says",179.3,179.56],["you",179.56,179.88],["are",179.88,180.02],["expected",180.02,180.44],["to",180.44,180.8],["pay",180.8,180.96],["£50",180.96,181.48],["towards",181.48,182.28]]},{"start":182.28,"end":185.02,"text":"the cost of anything caused by wear and tear.","words":[["the",182.28,182.6],["cost",182.6,182.86],["of",182.86,183.02],["anything",183.02,183.28],["caused",183.28,183.72],["by",183.72,184.1],["wear",184.1,184.44],["and",184.44,184.66],["tear.",184.66,185.02]]},{"start":185.44,"end":187.26,"text":"Yes, I realised that.","words":[["Yes,",185.44,185.8],["I",186.18,186.34],["realised",186.34,186.68],["that.",186.68,187.26]]},{"start":187.64,"end":188.82,"text":"That's not the problem.","words":[["That's",187.64,187.96],["not",187.96,188.1],["the",188.1,188.26],["problem.",188.26,188.82]]},{"start":189.02,"end":194.42,"text":"But I am worried about a couple of things getting worse over the next week.","words":[["But",189.02,189.26],["I",189.26,190.36],["am",190.36,190.72],["worried",190.72,191.1],["about",191.1,191.44],["a",191.44,191.64],["couple",191.64,191.9],["of",191.9,192.08],["things",192.08,192.34],["getting",192.34,192.64],["worse",192.64,193.08],["over",193.08,193.5],["the",193.5,193.62],["next",193.62,193.94],["week.",193.94,194.42]]},{"start":194.96,"end":200.14,"text":"Well, in that case, you can get a private company to fix it and get the money back","words":[["Well,",194.96,195.3],["in",195.48,195.62],["that",195.62,195.82],["case,",195.82,196.2],["you",196.58,196.78],["can",196.78,196.96],["get",196.96,197.1],["a",197.1,197.28],["private",197.28,197.62],["company",197.62,198.16],["to",198.16,198.36],["fix",198.36,198.6],["it",198.6,198.92],["and",198.92,199.38],["get",199.38,199.58],["the",199.58,199.72],["money",199.72,199.9],["back",199.9,200.14]]},{"start":200.14,"end":200.74,"text":"from the landlord.","words":[["from",200.14,200.32],["the",200.32,200.46],["landlord.",200.46,200.74]]},{"start":201.44,"end":204.72,"text":"I can give you a list of names and you can try to get them out today.","words":[["I",201.44,201.84],["can",201.84,201.98],["give",201.98,202.1],["you",202.1,202.2],["a",202.2,202.32],["list",202.32,202.46],["of",202.46,202.6],["names",202.6,202.98],["and",202.98,203.3],["you",203.3,203.4],["can",203.4,203.5],["try",203.5,203.74],["to",203.74,203.88],["get",203.88,204.02],["them",204.02,204.14],["out",204.14,204.28],["today.",204.28,204.72]]},{"start":205.28,"end":207.82,"text":"Okay. I think I'll have to do that.","words":[["Okay.",205.28,205.76],["I",206.16,206.6],["think",206.6,206.78],["I'll",206.78,206.94],["have",206.94,207.12],["to",207.12,207.3],["do",207.3,207.5],["that.",207.5,207.82]]},{"start":208.32,"end":211.62,"text":"Right. Now, where can the landlord get hold of you?","words":[["Right.",208.32,208.54],["Now,",208.98,209.26],["where",209.7,210.1],["can",210.1,210.28],["the",210.28,210.4],["landlord",210.4,210.62],["get",210.62,210.88],["hold",210.88,211.16],["of",211.16,211.42],["you?",211.42,211.62]]},{"start":212.02,"end":215.46,"text":"We've only got your college phone number. Can we get you on that?","words":[["We've",212.02,212.42],["only",212.42,212.58],["got",212.58,212.74],["your",212.74,212.88],["college",212.88,213.28],["phone",213.28,213.7],["number.",213.7,214.2],["Can",214.54,214.68],["we",214.68,214.82],["get",214.82,214.96],["you",214.96,215.06],["on",215.06,215.22],["that?",215.22,215.46]]},{"start":216.82,"end":222.44,"text":"It's very difficult, but you could leave a message on my mobile if I'm in class.","words":[["It's",216.82,217.3],["very",217.3,217.64],["difficult,",217.64,218.3],["but",218.56,218.74],["you",218.74,218.96],["could",218.96,219.24],["leave",219.24,219.46],["a",219.46,219.62],["message",219.62,219.88],["on",219.88,220.18],["my",220.18,220.38],["mobile",220.38,220.8],["if",220.8,221.66],["I'm",221.66,221.88],["in",221.88,221.98],["class.",221.98,222.44]]},{"start":224.22,"end":225.92,"text":"I'll give you the number, shall I?","words":[["I'll",224.22,224.7],["give",224.7,224.82],["you",224.82,225.0],["the",225.0,225.12],["number,",225.12,225.4],["shall",225.48,225.66],["I?",225.66,225.92]]},{"start":226.14,"end":227.16,"text":"Okay, that'd be great.","words":[["Okay,",226.14,226.54],["that'd",226.66,226.84],["be",226.84,226.92],["great.",226.92,227.16]]},{"start":227.86,"end":232.2,"text":"I'm sure the landlord will need to speak to you because you'll have to arrange to meet up with him","words":[["I'm",227.86,228.14],["sure",228.14,228.28],["the",228.28,228.42],["landlord",228.42,228.72],["will",228.72,229.0],["need",229.0,229.22],["to",229.22,229.38],["speak",229.38,229.64],["to",229.64,229.92],["you",229.92,230.1],["because",230.1,230.3],["you'll",230.3,230.56],["have",230.56,230.68],["to",230.68,230.84],["arrange",230.84,231.1],["to",231.1,231.34],["meet",231.34,231.48],["up",231.48,231.76],["with",231.76,232.0],["him",232.0,232.2]]},{"start":232.2,"end":233.86,"text":"after the work is completed","words":[["after",232.2,232.74],["the",232.74,232.94],["work",232.94,233.16],["is",233.16,233.32],["completed",233.32,233.86]]},{"start":233.86,"end":236.64,"text":"to sign the agreement that the work has been done.","words":[["to",233.86,234.36],["sign",234.36,234.66],["the",234.66,234.84],["agreement",234.84,235.28],["that",235.28,235.64],["the",235.64,235.8],["work",235.8,236.02],["has",236.02,236.18],["been",236.18,236.36],["done.",236.36,236.64]]},{"start":236.98,"end":237.48,"text":"Okay.","words":[["Okay.",236.98,237.48]]},{"start":241.34,"end":243.42,"text":"Before you hear the rest of the conversation,","words":[["Before",241.34,241.72],["you",241.72,241.96],["hear",241.96,242.16],["the",242.16,242.3],["rest",242.3,242.54],["of",242.54,242.68],["the",242.68,242.76],["conversation,",242.76,243.42]]},{"start":243.74,"end":247.64,"text":"you have some time to look at questions 7 to 10.","words":[["you",243.74,244.18],["have",244.18,244.34],["some",244.34,244.52],["time",244.52,244.88],["to",244.88,245.1],["look",245.1,245.2],["at",245.2,245.36],["questions",245.36,245.78],["7",245.78,246.62],["to",246.62,247.18],["10.",247.18,247.64]]},{"start":278.09,"end":281.81,"text":"Now listen and answer questions 7 to 10.","words":[["Now",278.09,278.39],["listen",278.39,278.73],["and",278.73,279.25],["answer",279.25,279.57],["questions",279.57,279.99],["7",279.99,280.87],["to",280.87,281.35],["10.",281.35,281.81]]},{"start":285.33,"end":287.65,"text":"Now, can you tell me exactly what's gone wrong?","words":[["Now,",285.33,285.55],["can",285.65,285.83],["you",285.83,285.97],["tell",285.97,286.15],["me",286.15,286.27],["exactly",286.27,286.71],["what's",286.71,287.17],["gone",287.17,287.33],["wrong?",287.33,287.65]]},{"start":288.35,"end":291.81,"text":"Yeah, um, well, first of all,","words":[["Yeah,",288.35,288.67],["um,",289.09,289.53],["well,",290.05,290.37],["first",290.89,291.23],["of",291.23,291.49],["all,",291.49,291.81]]},{"start":292.03,"end":295.01,"text":"there's a window in the bathroom that wouldn't open.","words":[["there's",292.03,292.41],["a",292.41,292.51],["window",292.51,292.81],["in",292.81,293.01],["the",293.01,293.11],["bathroom",293.11,293.57],["that",293.57,294.03],["wouldn't",294.03,294.45],["open.",294.45,295.01]]},{"start":295.01,"end":302.75,"text":"The paint seemed to be stuck. We've managed to get it open, though I don't know what damage it's caused.","words":[["The",295.01,295.93],["paint",295.93,296.33],["seemed",296.33,296.97],["to",296.97,297.19],["be",297.19,297.31],["stuck.",297.31,297.59],["We've",298.41,298.75],["managed",298.75,299.05],["to",299.05,299.29],["get",299.29,299.41],["it",299.41,299.53],["open,",299.53,299.83],["though",300.23,300.51],["I",300.51,300.93],["don't",300.93,301.17],["know",301.17,301.39],["what",301.39,301.61],["damage",301.61,302.03],["it's",302.03,302.35],["caused.",302.35,302.75]]},{"start":303.13,"end":308.33,"text":"I see. Yes, the landlord may want to check that the lock on it still works.","words":[["I",303.13,303.33],["see.",303.33,303.71],["Yes,",304.29,304.71],["the",305.11,305.21],["landlord",305.21,305.45],["may",305.45,305.79],["want",305.79,306.05],["to",306.05,306.29],["check",306.29,306.61],["that",306.61,306.77],["the",306.77,306.91],["lock",306.91,307.17],["on",307.17,307.33],["it",307.33,307.47],["still",307.47,307.79],["works.",307.79,308.33]]},{"start":309.09,"end":314.29,"text":"He checked all the taps and plumbing in the bathroom before you moved in, so they should be okay,","words":[["He",309.09,309.29],["checked",309.29,309.59],["all",309.59,309.83],["the",309.83,309.95],["taps",309.95,310.27],["and",310.27,310.53],["plumbing",310.53,310.83],["in",310.83,311.19],["the",311.19,311.33],["bathroom",311.33,311.77],["before",311.77,312.09],["you",312.09,312.29],["moved",312.29,312.55],["in,",312.55,312.87],["so",313.09,313.33],["they",313.33,313.55],["should",313.55,313.71],["be",313.71,313.87],["okay,",313.87,314.29]]},{"start":314.77,"end":317.93,"text":"but it may be worth another look, so I'll ask him to do that too.","words":[["but",314.77,314.95],["it",314.95,315.07],["may",315.07,315.31],["be",315.31,315.45],["worth",315.45,315.65],["another",315.65,315.89],["look,",315.89,316.21],["so",316.33,316.53],["I'll",316.53,316.79],["ask",316.79,316.95],["him",316.95,317.09],["to",317.09,317.19],["do",317.19,317.31],["that",317.31,317.53],["too.",317.53,317.93]]},{"start":318.53,"end":319.27,"text":"Oh, right.","words":[["Oh,",318.53,318.83],["right.",318.99,319.27]]},{"start":320.33,"end":325.53,"text":"Then we've noticed that the lights keep flickering, so I'm worried it means there's a problem","words":[["Then",320.33,320.89],["we've",320.89,321.31],["noticed",321.31,321.63],["that",321.63,321.79],["the",321.79,321.93],["lights",321.93,322.21],["keep",322.21,322.55],["flickering,",322.55,323.13],["so",323.41,323.83],["I'm",323.83,324.21],["worried",324.21,324.45],["it",324.45,324.63],["means",324.63,324.81],["there's",324.81,325.13],["a",325.13,325.21],["problem",325.21,325.53]]},{"start":325.53,"end":331.67,"text":"with the electricity, because we've also noticed that the washing machine keeps stopping and","words":[["with",325.53,325.79],["the",325.79,325.95],["electricity,",325.95,326.63],["because",327.15,328.05],["we've",328.05,328.55],["also",328.55,328.87],["noticed",328.87,329.25],["that",329.25,329.53],["the",329.53,329.69],["washing",329.69,330.03],["machine",330.03,330.43],["keeps",330.43,330.81],["stopping",330.81,331.41],["and",331.41,331.67]]},{"start":331.67,"end":333.55,"text":"starting in the middle of a wash.","words":[["starting",331.67,332.15],["in",332.15,332.57],["the",332.57,332.71],["middle",332.71,332.91],["of",332.91,333.03],["a",333.03,333.13],["wash.",333.13,333.55]]},{"start":333.93,"end":338.07,"text":"Well, that'll need looking at separately by a washing machine repair company.","words":[["Well,",333.93,334.13],["that'll",334.43,334.75],["need",334.75,334.89],["looking",334.89,335.13],["at",335.13,335.37],["separately",335.37,335.87],["by",335.87,336.23],["a",336.23,336.39],["washing",336.39,336.63],["machine",336.63,337.09],["repair",337.09,337.43],["company.",337.43,338.07]]},{"start":339.07,"end":343.75,"text":"We'll get them out and after they've looked at it, we can get someone else in to see","words":[["We'll",339.07,339.35],["get",339.35,339.51],["them",339.51,339.65],["out",339.65,339.89],["and",339.89,340.45],["after",340.45,340.81],["they've",340.81,341.09],["looked",341.09,341.29],["at",341.29,341.45],["it,",341.45,341.69],["we",341.75,342.07],["can",342.07,342.27],["get",342.27,342.41],["someone",342.41,342.75],["else",342.75,343.01],["in",343.01,343.33],["to",343.33,343.53],["see",343.53,343.75]]},{"start":343.75,"end":346.07,"text":"if there's a more general problem with the electricity.","words":[["if",343.75,343.89],["there's",343.89,344.07],["a",344.07,344.15],["more",344.15,344.33],["general",344.33,344.63],["problem",344.63,345.09],["with",345.09,345.33],["the",345.33,345.47],["electricity.",345.47,346.07]]},{"start":346.59,"end":350.39,"text":"The main switch may need replacing. It's quite old.","words":[["The",346.59,347.09],["main",347.09,347.27],["switch",347.27,347.57],["may",347.57,348.01],["need",348.01,348.23],["replacing.",348.23,348.81],["It's",349.21,349.71],["quite",349.71,349.95],["old.",349.95,350.39]]},{"start":351.13,"end":353.67,"text":"Actually, if we're getting an electrician out for that,","words":[["Actually,",351.13,351.63],["if",351.75,351.89],["we're",351.89,352.01],["getting",352.01,352.21],["an",352.21,352.39],["electrician",352.39,352.97],["out",352.97,353.13],["for",353.13,353.33],["that,",353.33,353.67]]},{"start":353.97,"end":357.45,"text":"he could look over the heating system before the winter sets in, couldn't he?","words":[["he",353.97,354.11],["could",354.11,354.31],["look",354.31,354.51],["over",354.51,354.71],["the",354.71,354.87],["heating",354.87,355.13],["system",355.13,355.75],["before",355.75,356.05],["the",356.05,356.21],["winter",356.21,356.37],["sets",356.37,356.73],["in,",356.73,356.99],["couldn't",357.07,357.27],["he?",357.27,357.45]]},{"start":357.89,"end":360.25,"text":"It was new last year though, so it shouldn't break down.","words":[["It",357.89,358.03],["was",358.03,358.13],["new",358.13,358.29],["last",358.29,358.53],["year",358.53,358.83],["though,",358.83,359.03],["so",359.03,359.29],["it",359.29,359.47],["shouldn't",359.47,359.71],["break",359.71,359.89],["down.",359.89,360.25]]},{"start":360.61,"end":361.89,"text":"That would be a good idea.","words":[["That",360.61,360.89],["would",360.89,361.03],["be",361.03,361.17],["a",361.17,361.31],["good",361.31,361.43],["idea.",361.43,361.89]]},{"start":363.13,"end":365.29,"text":"The only other thing is in the hall.","words":[["The",363.13,363.63],["only",363.63,363.89],["other",363.89,364.17],["thing",364.17,364.51],["is",364.51,364.83],["in",364.83,364.95],["the",364.95,365.05],["hall.",365.05,365.29]]},{"start":366.09,"end":369.89,"text":"The carpet had started curling up at the edges where the door opens,","words":[["The",366.09,366.25],["carpet",366.25,366.61],["had",366.61,366.87],["started",366.87,367.27],["curling",367.27,367.63],["up",367.63,367.93],["at",367.93,368.07],["the",368.07,368.21],["edges",368.21,368.59],["where",368.59,368.95],["the",368.95,369.15],["door",369.15,369.41],["opens,",369.41,369.89]]},{"start":370.25,"end":371.87,"text":"and we've had to stick it down.","words":[["and",370.25,370.69],["we've",370.69,370.91],["had",370.91,371.05],["to",371.05,371.19],["stick",371.19,371.37],["it",371.37,371.53],["down.",371.53,371.87]]},{"start":371.87,"end":376.85,"text":"We just used ordinary glue so it didn't mark the paintwork. I hope that's okay.","words":[["We",371.87,372.83],["just",372.83,373.05],["used",373.05,373.37],["ordinary",373.37,373.79],["glue",373.79,374.13],["so",374.13,374.41],["it",374.41,374.55],["didn't",374.55,374.77],["mark",374.77,374.97],["the",374.97,375.15],["paintwork.",375.15,375.59],["I",376.01,376.13],["hope",376.13,376.27],["that's",376.27,376.55],["okay.",376.55,376.85]]},{"start":377.25,"end":379.89,"text":"Hmm, you've had quite a few problems, haven't you?","words":[["Hmm,",377.25,377.65],["you've",378.01,378.19],["had",378.19,378.25],["quite",378.25,378.43],["a",378.43,378.61],["few",378.61,378.81],["problems,",378.81,379.33],["haven't",379.45,379.75],["you?",379.75,379.89]]},{"start":380.55,"end":385.33,"text":"That's not very satisfactory. I will get onto the landlord. I'm really sorry about this.","words":[["That's",380.55,380.89],["not",380.89,381.01],["very",381.01,381.23],["satisfactory.",381.23,381.81],["I",382.43,382.55],["will",382.55,382.73],["get",382.73,382.91],["onto",382.91,383.13],["the",383.13,383.29],["landlord.",383.29,383.55],["I'm",384.11,384.27],["really",384.27,384.45],["sorry",384.45,384.71],["about",384.71,384.93],["this.",384.93,385.33]]},{"start":386.21,"end":389.23,"text":"Well, as long as it can all be sorted quickly.","words":[["Well,",386.21,386.73],["as",386.99,387.21],["long",387.21,387.43],["as",387.43,387.59],["it",387.59,387.71],["can",387.71,387.89],["all",387.89,388.09],["be",388.09,388.21],["sorted",388.21,388.63],["quickly.",388.63,389.23]]},{"start":393.17,"end":400.67,"text":"That is the end of Part 1. You'll now have 45 seconds to check your answers to Part 1.","words":[["That",393.17,393.55],["is",393.55,393.75],["the",393.75,393.93],["end",393.93,394.13],["of",394.13,394.29],["Part",394.29,394.55],["1.",394.55,394.85],["You'll",395.77,396.09],["now",396.09,396.25],["have",396.25,396.57],["45",396.57,397.27],["seconds",397.27,397.97],["to",397.97,398.65],["check",398.65,398.95],["your",398.95,399.15],["answers",399.15,399.57],["to",399.57,399.91],["Part",399.91,400.19],["1.",400.19,400.67]]}]}